<!--
  Splash screen icon: frame 0 of the companion's idle animation.

  The cat is the default species (Constants.DEFAULT_PET_TYPE), so this is the
  pet a fresh install meets. The paths are the shapes from
  res/raw/pet_cat_idle.json evaluated at frame 0 (ears, body, eyes, pupils,
  highlights, cheeks, mouth) with their layer/group transforms baked into
  absolute coordinates — no masked or gradient layers in that art, so the
  bake is exact. Sparkles are zero-scale at frame 0 and are dropped.

  Art occupies the middle 200dp of a 288dp canvas because Android 12 draws
  splash icons inside a 240dp area with a 192dp guaranteed-visible centre.
  Regenerate for another species with the bake script's fit/size/art-height
  options (canvas 288, art height 200, frame 0).
-->
